      {
        "text": "Sonya Marie Harper has represented the 6th District since October 2015. She was a television news producer and executive director of Grow Greater Englewood. She chairs the House Agriculture & Conservation Committee. Her campaign says she authored the Illinois Farmer Equity Act and the state's cannabis social equity provisions, along with laws on school lead testing and residents' right to garden. In a 2026 op-ed, she wrote that cannabis equity work remains unfinished.",
        "cites": [1, 2, 3, 4],
