            "cites": [2]
          },
          {
            "text": "She chairs the House Agriculture & Conservation Committee.",
            "cites": [3]
          },
          {
            "text": "Her campaign says she authored the Illinois Farmer Equity Act and the state's cannabis social equity provisions, along with laws on school lead testing and residents' right to garden.",
