          {
            "text": "In a 2026 op-ed, she wrote that cannabis equity work remains unfinished.",
            "cites": [4]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Her website highlights a law she supported to ban certain chemicals in cosmetics. She sponsored a law to eliminate food deserts. She proposed a bill for state institutions to buy from local farmers. She sponsored a resolution to create a gun violence task force.",
